('president','PRESIDENT KASSYM-JOMART TOKAYEV HELD THE 2ND MEETING OF KAZAKHSTAN’S ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE DEVELOPMENT COUNCIL','[RU needs review] ПРЕЗИДЕНТ КАСЫМ-ЖОМАРТ ТОКАЕВ ПРОВЕЛ ВТОРОЕ ЗАСЕДАНИЕ СОВЕТА ПО РАЗВИТИЮ ИИ','A defining moment of GITEX AI Kazakhstan 2026 was the 2nd Meeting of the AI Development Council, chaired by President Kassym-Jomart Tokayev.','[RU needs review] Ключевым событием GITEX AI Kazakhstan 2026 стало второе заседание Совета по развитию ИИ под председательством Президента.','[{"image":"https://www.gitexcac.com/contents/Theme-2025/images/Ai-council-Meeting.jpg"}]',11),
('government','POWERED BY GOVERNMENT ALIGNMENT','[RU needs review] ПРИ ПОДДЕРЖКЕ ГОСУДАРСТВА','Hosted by the Ministry of Artificial Intelligence and Digital Development of the Republic of Kazakhstan, in strategic partnership with Astana Hub','[RU needs review] При поддержке Министерства искусственного интеллекта и цифрового развития Республики Казахстан и Astana Hub','[{"video":"https://www.gitexcac.com/images/quotes_sec_animated_bg.mp4","image":"https://www.gitexcac.com/Uploads//Posts/Speakers/Speaker_1.jpg.jpeg","quote":"Hosting GITEX in Almaty confirms Kazakhstan’s growing role as a regional hub for technology leaders, startups, and investment.","name":"H.E. Zhaslan Madiyev"}]',12),
